00:08:38,399 --> 00:08:44,399
Little is a comedy, fantasy, romance film directed by Tina Gordon.

3
00:12:57,599 --> 00:13:03,599
Jordan Sanders, a take-no-prisoners tech mogul, wakes up one morning in the body
of her 13-year-old self right before a do-or-die presentation.

4
00:17:16,799 --> 00:17:22,799
Her beleaguered assistant April is the only one in on the secret that her daily tormentor
is now trapped in an awkward tween body, just as everything is on the line.

5
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:42,000
Jordan Sanders, played by Regina Hall.

6
00:25:55,199 --> 00:26:01,199
April Williams, played by Issa Rae.

7
